01:13:28.340 --> 01:13:35.340
one shoe kill another shoe. There is very strong rumors, as do by Lieberman and others,

01:13:35.340 --> 01:13:43.340
that four and a half million dollars were passed from the CIA to the Shah's party.

01:13:43.340 --> 01:13:46.340
Four and a half million dollars.

01:13:46.340 --> 01:13:47.340
So it says we win?

01:13:47.340 --> 01:13:52.340
We bring the Israeli government down. If the Shah goes on with Shamir, the government is going to fall.

01:13:52.340 --> 01:13:56.340
The government wanted the labor to win, and these rumors that four and a half million dollars

01:13:56.340 --> 01:13:58.340
give it to the shark fund.

01:13:58.340 --> 01:14:00.340
Right.

01:14:00.340 --> 01:14:02.340
CIO.

01:14:02.340 --> 01:14:04.340
Paris becomes the Prime Minister

01:14:04.340 --> 01:14:06.340
and then they could negotiate with the Palestinians.

01:14:06.340 --> 01:14:08.340
We don't know.

01:14:08.340 --> 01:14:10.340
Alright, but now I say, I say I do.

01:14:10.340 --> 01:14:12.340
Israelis want to rule.

01:14:12.340 --> 01:14:14.340
Alright, one second.

01:14:14.340 --> 01:14:16.340
We don't know, but I'm talking to others.

01:14:16.340 --> 01:14:18.340
Now, say, we dismiss, ladies and gentlemen,

01:14:18.340 --> 01:14:20.340
we don't have much time.

01:14:20.340 --> 01:14:22.340
I don't know this.

01:14:22.340 --> 01:14:24.340
We dismiss the rumors that your party

01:14:24.340 --> 01:14:28.340
that your party was motivated by the secret funds it received from the American socialists.

01:14:28.340 --> 01:14:30.340
We don't believe in it.

01:14:30.340 --> 01:14:34.340
We don't believe it.

01:14:34.340 --> 01:14:42.340
But your leadership and wisdom on this matter is solely needed.

01:14:42.340 --> 01:14:50.340
It is time to act according to the Torah rather than according to political expediency.

01:14:50.340 --> 01:14:57.340
Respectfully yours, whoever wants to sign it, please, I don't know what I would like you to do,

01:14:57.340 --> 01:15:05.340
Amy, do me a favor, and Maurice, you may be repressed, whoever wants to delete it, I'll find a way.

01:15:05.340 --> 01:15:11.340
If you don't feel like you want to sign it, don't do it, because you have a passion, you have many people,

01:15:11.340 --> 01:15:16.340
so if you feel like you want to do it, you do it, you don't feel like you want to do it, you press another sign.

01:15:20.340 --> 01:15:50.320
Thank you.

